/F2 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(>> Solution to Question 15:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Examine the grammatical rules of cleft sentences \('it'-clefts and 'wh'-clefts\) for establishing empirical scientific emphasis.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Nature and Function of Cleft Sentences:) Tj
T*
(   A cleft sentence divides a single proposition into two distinct sections to highlight a) Tj
T*
(   specific constituent \(the focus\) and treat the remainder as background or presupposed) Tj
T*
(   information.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
